<title>JAPAN: MOF says plans to hold T-bill auction on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>MOF says plans to hold T-bill auction on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry is planning to offer Treasury Bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction on Wednesday, a ministry official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The offer is likely to be for the purpose of rolling over 1.4 trillion yen worth of the 166th six-month T-bills due to mature on August 11, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
